{"step_index":263,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T18:47:47Z","thinking":"**Adding Input Styling Rules**\n\nAdding new CSS rules to style the AI chat input row. These rules will set up a flexbox layout, add spacing with padding and gap, apply a background color, and create a border. The input element within the row will flex to take available space.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Add AI chat input row styling to style.css\"","EndLine":"1402","Instruction":"\"Add ai-chat-input-row styles before Footer\"","ReplacementContent":"\".ai-checks-box {\\n    background: white;\\n    padding: 1rem;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\\n}\\n\\n/* AI Chat Input Styling */\\n.ai-chat-input-row {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 0.5rem;\\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\\n    align-items: center;\\n}\\n\\n.ai-chat-input-row input {\\n    flex: 1;\\n    height: 42px;\\n    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;\\n    border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    outline: none;\\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\\n    font-family: inherit;\\n    transition: all 0.2s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.ai-chat-input-row input:focus {\\n    border-color: var(--primary);\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12);\\n}\"","StartLine":"1395","TargetContent":"\".ai-checks-box {\\n    background: white;\\n    padding: 1rem;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\\n}\"","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Madziva\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\qualification-verification-system\\\\src\\\\main\\\\resources\\\\static\\\\css\\\\style.css\"","toolAction":"\"Update style.css\"","toolSummary":"\"Add ai-chat-input-row rules in style.css\""}}]}
