{"step_index":275,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:23:14Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T21:23:14+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T21:23:14+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2521cc9f-1824-4718-8f41-13ddedc3e34e/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 74\nTotal Bytes: 5072\nShowing lines 1 to 70\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Walkthrough: Zimbabwe State University Degrees & Qualifications Database Seeding\n2: \n3: We have populated the Qualification Verification System database with **83 qualifications** across **8 Zimbabwe State Universities**, including authentic degree programs, 10 distinct students per university, and exact formatting for Zimbabwe Open University (ZOU) IT and PGDE qualifications.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 🏛️ Universities & Data Distribution\n8: \n9: The database is seeded with 8 premier public State Universities in Zimbabwe (and preserves the initial 2 baseline institutions for legacy test suite compliance):\n10: \n11: | University Name | Code | Officer User | Degrees Seeded | Example Student ID |\n12: |---|---|---|---|---|\n13: | **Zimbabwe Open University** (ZOU) | `ZOU-004` | `officer_zou` | 10 | `ITM 190020`, `EH250001` |\n14: | **University of Zimbabwe** (UZ) | `UZ-001` | `officer_uz` | 10 | `R203112B`, `R184512M` |\n15: | **National University of Science and Technology** (NUST) | `NUST-002` | `officer_nust` | 10 | `N0205678G`, `N02143